#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:117
msgid ""
"Set ``actor.model.model_type: gr00t_n1d7`` in the task YAML. RLinf loads the"
" model and processor from ``model_path``; ``data_config_class`` is only used"
" for N1.5. The checkpoint must include ``processor_config.json``, "
"``statistics.json``, and ``embodiment_id.json`` at its root or in a "
"``processor/`` subdirectory."
msgstr ""
"在任务 YAML 中设置 ``actor.model.model_type: gr00t_n1d7``。RLinf 从 ``model_path`` "
"加载模型和处理器，``data_config_class`` 仅用于 N1.5。检查点根目录或其 ``processor/`` 子目录中，必须包含 "
"``processor_config.json``、``statistics.json`` 和 ``embodiment_id.json``。"

