msgid ""
"Match the checkpoint's language key and the environment's action order "
"explicitly. For example, these entries belong under ``env.train.isaaclab``:"
msgstr "显式匹配检查点的语言键和环境的动作顺序。例如，以下条目应放在 ``env.train.isaaclab`` 下："

#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:133
msgid ""
"Without these entries, the language key remains "
"``annotation.human.action.task_description`` and actions retain the model's "
"dictionary order. When set, ``keys`` must list every action part to emit, in"
" environment order. Use ``uv run --no-sync`` to preserve the pins."
msgstr ""
"未提供这些条目时，语言键仍为 "
"``annotation.human.action.task_description``，动作保持模型的字典顺序。设置后，``keys`` "
"必须按环境顺序列出所有需要输出的动作部分。使用 ``uv run --no-sync`` 保留固定依赖版本。"

