#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:268
msgid "Action chunks across resets"
msgstr "跨重置的动作块"

#: source/experimental-features/rlinf_vla_posttraining.rst:270
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab resets completed environments inside ``step()``. For absolute "
"joint-position policies, set "
"``env.train.isaaclab.hold_pose_on_midchunk_reset: true`` to replace the "
"remaining old-episode actions with the returned joint positions until the "
"next chunk. The configured ``states`` vector must contain only those joint "
"positions, in the same order and units as the environment actions. This "
"option defaults to false and does not apply to delta-position, velocity, or "
"torque actions."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 在 ``step()`` 内重置已结束的环境。对于绝对关节位置策略，设置 "
"``env.train.isaaclab.hold_pose_on_midchunk_reset: "
"true``，可在下一个动作块到来前，用返回的关节位置替换旧回合剩余的动作。配置的 ``states`` "
"向量必须仅包含这些关节位置，顺序和单位与环境动作一致。该选项默认关闭，不适用于增量位置、速度或力矩动作。"

